  # 7 Careers That Are AI-Proof in 2026
  
  [![Averageguymedianow](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:32:32/1*Ase14syN_srkLh6KtioU-Q.jpeg)](https://medium.com/@averageguymedianow?source=post_page---byline--ff3d5ca59ce0---------------------------------------)
  
