  85 Predictions for AI and the Law in 2026
  
  by: [Oliver Roberts](https://natlawreview.com/author/oliver-roberts),
  [AI & the Law Newsletter](https://natlawreview.com/organization/ai-law-newsletter)
  
  Monday, January 5, 2026
  
  [![Robotic hand holding digital scales of justice](https://natlawreview.com/sites/default/files/styles/article_image/public/2026-01/AI%20Legal%20tech%20cloud%20Law%20machine%20learning.jpg.webp?itok=D8Mshvps)](https://natlawreview.com/article/85-predictions-ai-and-law-2026)
  
