  2. Uses of AI by teachers
     AI offers multiple ways to enhance our teaching that can help students learn in our classrooms,
  
  AI offers multiple ways to enhance our teaching that can help students learn in our classrooms,
  as will be illustrated next on what I am doing in two of my courses, Contracts and Negotiations.
  
  For both courses, I reviewed each class to uncover possible AI applications for teaching
  responsible AI use by students or enhancing my teaching. Then, I designed an AI application for
  selected lessons and either built a specialized bot for students use or suggested that they use any
  free off-the-shelf chatbot. I offer here a sample of AI applications to illustrate the approach.
  
